# Wave W17-I (Mt. Millstone — Upper Halls): spray floor — spray-bright wet flags, one value up from the Lower Halls’ wet mill floor, the great falls’ spray sparkling across the walking line where the upper air is full of water (design: tiered great falls dropping past the ledge paths). The Upper Halls’ own floor, twin-split from the Lower by value + spray lightening.
